'''E-792''' (ミニハリケーンサイクロン, ''Mini Harikēn Saikuron'', '''Mini Hurricane Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and variant of [[The Perfect Cyclone]] that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. She was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = E-792
|image = e 792.png
|first appearance = '''ZL:''' [[ZL 38-1|Sub-chapter 38 - ZL 38-1]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
