==Enemy==
Very similar to the original, this resilient midranger relies on her Long Distance attacks to apply pressure, which reaches all the way to 520 range, further compounded by a 2-second 25% Weaken at 100% chance and a very fast attack cycle essentially giving it full uptime. Though her blindspot isn't negligible, getting there is often easier said than done. 

==Strategy==
Anything capable of outranging her will work wonders. [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]] is especially handy due to his great DPS and ability to [[Slow]] Floating enemies on top of already impressive piercing. [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] alternatives such as [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]] will perform similarly well, even being able to [[Curse]] her with [[Talents]]. Just make sure whatever you use does not get weakened.

