==Trivia==
*E-792 and [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] are the only [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclones]] who are confirmed to be female.
*Although E-792's Japanese description says she pushes others away, she doesn't have the Knockback ability, as 突き放し ''tsukihanashi'' typically refers to ''socially'' pushing others away; distancing oneself from others. It can also mean "to treat coldly".

